  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">222179_FY24_OCHA_Syria_EQ Response - Education provision in intersecting crises in NW Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Envelope 1: Knowledge is Power, Especially in Emergencies &amp;#8211; A holistic approach to education provision for girls and boys affected by intersecting crises in Northwest Syria
 
 The project will provide formal education throughout the school term (until May/June 2024), and non-formal education will be provided through a summer school from June to August 2024. Project dates will be 1 December 2023 to 31 August 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
